ccessibility Standards',\n      body: 'Web accessibility ensures websites are usable by people with disabilities. Follow WCAG guidelines: provide alt text for images, ensure keyboard navigation, use semantic HTML, maintain sufficient color contrast, add ARIA labels, and test with screen readers. Accessibility benefits all users.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['programming', 'web', 'accessibility']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Italian Risotto Masterclass',\n      body: 'Perfect risotto requires Arborio or Carnaroli rice, warm stock, patience, and constant stirring. Toast the rice in butter, add wine, then ladle warm stock gradually while stirring. The starch releases slowly, creating a creamy texture. Finish with butter and Parmigiano-Reggiano.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['cooking', 'italian', 'recipes']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Artificial Neural Networks Explained',\n      body: 'Neural networks are computing systems inspired by biological neural networks. They consist of layers of interconnected nodes (neurons) that process information. Deep learning uses many hidden layers to learn hierarchical representations. Applications include image recognition, natural language processing, and autonomous vehicles.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['programming', 'ai', 'deep-learning']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Sustainable Living Tips',\n      body: 'Reduce your environmental footprint by minimizing single-use plastics, composting food waste, choosing renewable energy, buying local produce, reducing water usage, and using public transport or cycling. Small daily choices collectively make a significant environmental impact.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['environment', 'lifestyle', 'sustainability']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Chess Strategy for Intermediates',\n      body: 'Improve your chess by studying openings, understanding pawn structure, controlling the center, developing pieces early, and thinking several moves ahead. Learn tactical patterns like pins, forks, skewers, and discovered attacks. Analyze your games to identify mistakes and patterns.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['games', 'chess', 'strategy']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'RESTful API Best Practices',\n      body: 'Design RESTful APIs with consistent naming conventions, proper HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE), meaningful status codes, pagination for collections, versioning, authentication, and comprehensive error responses. Use JSON for request and response bodies. Document with OpenAPI specification.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['programming', 'api', 'rest']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Nordic Hiking Adventures',\n      body: 'Scandinavia offers breathtaking hiking through fjords, mountains, and arctic landscapes. Norway Trolltunga and Preikestolen are iconic. Sweden Kungsleden trail spans 270 miles. Finland offers midnight sun hiking in summer. Pack layers, waterproof gear, and be prepared for rapidly changing weather.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['travel', 'hiking', 'europe']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Espresso Brewing Techniques',\n      body: 'Perfect espresso requires freshly roasted beans, proper grind size, correct dose (18-20g), consistent tamping pressure, water temperature around 200°F, and 25-30 second extraction time. The result should be a balanced shot with a rich crema layer. Adjust grind size to control flow rate.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['cooking', 'coffee', 'techniques']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Version Control with Git',\n      body: 'Git is the most widely used version control system. Key commands include init, clone, add, commit, push, pull, branch, merge, and rebase. Use feature branches for development, pull requests for code review, and tags for releases. Write meaningful commit messages that explain why changes were made.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['programming', 'git', 'tools']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'The Science of Sleep',\n      body: 'Quality sleep is essential for health. Adults need 7-9 hours nightly. Sleep cycles through stages including light sleep, deep sleep, and REM. Improve sleep hygiene by maintaining consistent schedules, limiting screen time before bed, keeping rooms cool and dark, and avoiding caffeine after noon.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['health', 'science', 'sleep']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Watercolor Painting Basics',\n      body: 'Watercolor painting uses water-soluble pigments on paper. Start with basic techniques: wet-on-wet for soft blends, wet-on-dry for sharp edges, and dry brush for texture. Use quality paper (140lb cold press), a limited palette of primary colors, and practice controlling water ratios.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['art', 'painting', 'watercolor']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Blockchain Technology Overview',\n      body: 'Blockchain is a distributed ledger technology where data is stored in linked blocks secured by cryptography. Each block contains a hash of the previous block, creating an immutable chain. Applications extend beyond cryptocurrency to supply chain, healthcare records, and voting systems.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['technology', 'blockchain', 'crypto']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Thai Cooking Fundamentals',\n      body: 'Thai cuisine balances sweet, sour, salty, spicy, and bitter flavors. Essential ingredients include fish sauce, lime, lemongrass, galangal, Thai basil, and coconut milk. Master dishes like pad thai, green curry, tom yum soup, and mango sticky rice. Fresh herbs and aromatics are key.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['cooking', 'thai', 'asian']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Astrophotography Guide',\n      body: 'Capturing the night sky requires a DSLR or mirrorless camera, wide-angle lens, sturdy tripod, and remote shutter release. Use manual mode with wide aperture (f/2.8 or lower), high ISO (1600-6400), and long exposure (15-30 seconds). The 500 rule helps avoid star trails.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['photography', 'astronomy', 'technique