tables, salt, and water. Maintain proper salt ratios (2-3%), keep vegetables submerged, and ferment at room temperature for optimal results.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['cooking', 'fermentation', 'preservation']),\n    },\n  ];\n}\n","userModified":false}}
